# Generated meshes go through LFS. There are 1,961 of them and they total
# 466 MB; committed as ordinary blobs they would sit in the history forever,
# and this set has already been regenerated once -- every file in it was an
# 84-byte empty mesh that a generator reported as a success.
data/generated_spaceflight_cad/*.stl filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
